Package: hrd
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: hrd local build <root@localhost>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: systemd (>= 254), iproute2, nftables, wireguard-tools, dbus-daemon, gnome-keyring, libcap2-bin, @SHLIBS@
Recommends: hrd-client
Conflicts: cordial-hrd
Replaces: cordial-hrd
Suggests: cage, mesa-vulkan-drivers
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/kamasix/HRD
Description: HRD, a manager for many Cordial clients
 A daemon (hrdd), a command line (hrdctl), an optional web panel (hrd-panel)
 and two small privileged helpers that run many independent Cordial clients, each
 with its own profile, process set and proxy, on a Debian server without a desktop.
 .
 The package starts nothing by itself: no client, no network change. It does not
 contain the Roblox application or the client binary (see hrd-client);
 the Roblox build is imported by the operator with `hrdctl runtime import`.
